@title Mega Man Zero 4 (USA)
@file Megaman Zero 4 (U).gba
@game B4ZE
@chip EEPROM
@save skip: EEPROM stays blank through the whole opening stage (Easy Mode); the first save is at the caravan after this stage's boss, a wall-mounted cannon in the land battleship that answers every hit with rapid beams and orb chains; a charged jump shot into its mouth hurts it, but blind frame timing never got Zero through more than one hit in budget
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba

# New game in EASY MODE, intro text skipped with START, then the opening
# stage: across the caravan trucks (dash jumps L+A over the wide gaps, wall
# jumps up the tall containers), shoot the Variants and the shielded flame
# thrower from behind, ride onto the land battleship and walk into its engine
# room (checkpoint boss: boss health bar filled, Zero in control).
# Controls: A jump, B buster (hold to charge), L dash.
# Seen while authoring: nba runs this game with different lag: Zero's hurt
# flash and enemy animation phases differ on nba in most fights (f6166 nba
# shows Zero hit and a standing Variant where dingbat-bios and mgba show a
# flying one; f6514, f8048, f10028, f10270); dingbat-bios and mgba stay
# frame-identical through the whole stage.
